{"parse": {"title": "AR-5", "pageid": 89275, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-4\" title=\"AR-4\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-5</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-6\" title=\"AR-6\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">5</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A8.80.E8.BE.9E.E4.B9.8B.E5.A4.96\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"言辞之外\">言辞之外</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 言辞之外</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">What Was Not Expressed</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>清晨的沙滩本该是最适合独自放松，散步的场所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提早到达，再花些时间理清思绪，苏菲亚的计划做得不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但事情常常无法如人所料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚，你到得比我晚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>瞧，我今天在阿波罗星初升时就来海滩边上了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>围绕着37的人群似乎比昨天还要多，她蹦跳着朝苏菲亚招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>处在人群中心的还有另一个熟悉的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>噢，我们的除错师也来了？看来这的确是一个完美的时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>兄弟们，姐妹们，到这儿来，瞧瞧这回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210手里高举着一本杂志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——我的文章可绝不会比她在这里玩的游戏更幼稚，更浪费时间！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一些人们发出了笑声——岛上的人们早已习惯了这种针锋相对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210自信地在苏菲亚与37面前摊开一本杂志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杂志折起的页角已经皱得不成样子。一篇数学证明被淹没在花边新闻与各种启事之间，蜷缩在版面角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好在文章的作者仍有地方署名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>“《试论真理的语言结构》”……210，这是你的签名？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高大的辩论家不置可否地摊开手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>诚然，在“流溢”后，我们就切断了和外界的联络，被动地成为一座孤岛……但总需要有人迈开创新的步伐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>向岛外的数学杂志投稿，重新建立我们对外的联系，只是我个人诸多创举中的第一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-510701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-510701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-510701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅰ：</div><div>可我们本来就是一座孤岛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……这好像也并不是数学论文？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚将杂志翻过来，很确定这是一本常见的铁道周刊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而210的论文赫然位列“逸闻摘抄”栏目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>竟然在这种杂志上发表了关于真理的论文，唔……编辑推荐理由是，“虽然内容晦涩不明，但言辞堪称优美，可供诸位读者摘抄。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>还挺厉害的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句夸赞的确出自真心实意，辩论家的气势也愈发嚣张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯独37不服气地抱起双臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我也看了那篇文章，完全是漏洞百出的误导。你的命题就是错误的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>真理的美在于简明，过多的修饰只会造成曲解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它太繁琐，修饰过多，缺少最为重要的推论过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>正确的推演比任何巧妙的言辞都更有说服力，但在你的文章里却被简单带过不提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>大部分篇幅都浪费在了无意义的夸赞上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>是吗？我并不认为它比小孩子的玩闹更缺乏意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>还是说，你所指的简明就是这种游戏，简单的推理和加减法更接近你的真理？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>那我倒能明白了，你就继续玩耍吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在旁等待的孩子们簇拥到他的身边，形成一团热闹喧哗的云。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在好奇心颇重的年纪，他们总是对各种精巧的讽刺与辩论饶有兴致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而争论与冲突，高谈阔论与雄心壮志，恰好汇聚于同一个数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>210。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你的数字里明明有2，3，5，7。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>而你只是把它们一股脑搅在一起，没有加以善用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>哦，这是在指责我既无热诚，也不在意秩序，还时常随口发表意见以彰显自己的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——真不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>但正因如此，我能坦率地说出其他人心底埋藏的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你的游戏实在是太简单了，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>这样执着于小孩子的简单算术，究竟能获得什么真理的启示？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>诚然，我们信任赫尔墨斯之星的光辉，甘心在你的指引下当一颗伴星。可你也得多考虑些他人的感受，嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚及时开口，打破了僵硬的氛围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这并不是那么严肃的事，210，我们只是消磨餐前散步的时光，37也没有强迫其他人参与。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但我也同意这个游戏太过简单。那以你来看，它还需要什么改动呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>当然是把题目变得更难，更具备挑战性，还要加入计分和排名环节，并引入淘汰和复活机制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>把所有参与者在沙滩上分组，以三人为一单位进行竞赛。还要准备专门的场地和特定的时段——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>什么？什么？不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37言辞激烈地打断了210的滔滔不绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这些游戏和题目是休留下来的！它很简单，因为休就是为孩子们设计的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我也不想和任何人竞争，只是想明白休留下的答案数列里隐藏的含义！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我知道，如果它变得复杂，能让参与者体会运用智力的乐趣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但事物的美妙正在于它的简单，就像数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>去掉所有的修饰，“1”仍然是“1”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>一个人，一块石头，一棵树，现象的物质都会腐朽、衰败、更迭，但“1”会一直存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这是很简单的游戏，也足以蕴含最美妙的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不必使简单的事变得复杂。花哨的外表能博得一时的关注，但它也偏离了重要的本质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>那又如何？你也承认，它的确单调又枯燥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我只是把话讲得更使人信服，并没有曲解任何既定的道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有几位旁听的教众微微点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们并不认为这段辩驳很无趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在学派中最为随处可见的就是分析与讨论，以及无穷无尽的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而37做出的回应是在沙滩上画出几道方格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我从苏菲亚那儿听说了这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>“跳房子”，在岛外它是很受欢迎的儿童游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>规则很简单，从根本上来说，只是从这头跳到那一头。我学得很快，也一直记得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>这不意外，有什么是你学不会的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不，我想说正因为简单，所以它很容易理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>所以它能从苏菲亚曾经在的地方传到岛上，而且还有孩子在玩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昨天在海滩上玩耍的那群孩子笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-511801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-511801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-511801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众小孩Ⅰ：</div><div>没错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众小孩Ⅱ：</div><div>37带我们玩的游戏也很有意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>向小支持者们打了个招呼，37继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>让休设计的游戏变得复杂，不就失去了它最重要的特质吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>真是场精彩的辩驳，几位教众已经开始用海贝打赌哪一方会获胜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在岛上，这样的辩论也许会从清晨一直持续到教典规定的缄默时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那样的话37的游戏就将无从继续，更重要的研究也只能悲惨地持续搁置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除错师感到自己有义务来纠正局面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你们双方都提交了有力的论点。我认为——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你说得对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>是的，37说得对——什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>正如你所言，这是个儿童游戏，本质不会改变。那样我倒是十分好奇，你能在这样的“简单”中获得什么启示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>谁都能一眼看出的答案，你却认为这些数字的组合有什么“深意”——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210讥讽地摊开手，耸了耸肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>不过是花些时间而已，当然比不上我们伟大的赫尔墨斯之星将做的证明重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>继续吧，弄清楚这个儿童游戏到底有多值得在乎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我已经迫不及待地想看看结局了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-5"}}